rows.en:
Heh heh heh...
You know, you're rather popular.
People say there's a cute girl among the newspaper club's first-years...{p}

Oh, you don't?
How surprising.
To think a girl this cute has no sweetheart...{p}

His name was Yuya Igarashi.
Handsome, intelligent, composed...
He was like a prince straight out of a fairy tale.{p}

"I'll come back in three years.
To take you as my bride..."
With those words, he got into the car.{p}

Unable to bear the shock of his death, I finally took to my bed.
A high fever went on for days.
What came to my fever-tormented mind was a dream of Yuya.{p}

...I don't know how long I slept.
Perhaps I was still inside the dream...
A dusky gloom had spread around me, neither dream nor reality.{p}

Heh heh heh...
My, {a}, your eyes have gone so wide...
...So you can't believe it after all?{p}

Scary...?
Why...?
He keeps me bound to him only because he loves me that much.{p}

A reason...?
...I suppose so.
Anyone would answer that way if they were suddenly asked something like this.{p}

Heh heh heh...
Very well.
I wonder what type would suit you best, {a}.{p}

You really are picky, aren't you?
Maybe that's why you don't have a sweetheart.
You haven't truly fallen in love yet.{p}

A bright red candle rose up in my mind.
Its flame flickering, the candle was burning down fast...
...Maybe I really didn't have much time left.{p}

"Heh heh heh...
Don't be shy.
I'll let you meet him."{p}

Oh, the happy look on his face at that moment...!
Without even wiping away the blood running down him, he dashed straight into the school building and vanished.
Dying without ever once setting foot in a classroom must have left him with terrible regret.{p}

"I'm sorry.
Actually... I was joking."
I apologized in a small voice.{p}

That boy who said he liked me... he died, all of a sudden.
On the train tracks, in the middle of the night...
...They wrote it off as suicide, but I just can't accept that.{p}

Yuya is always at my side, watching me intently.
...Yes.
Even now, at this very moment...☆{p}

And now someone has finally died...
So please, I'm begging you, don't make Yuya angry.
The beloved one who stands behind me...{p}

Listen, spirit rapping.
Yuya is angry.
He's watching everything from behind me, you know...{p}
